wrQ4_TxeaDLywf7AiyIzduu_t2RRHb9FpoD-cZd3BYtr7L32n0ChBM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJ4zD_YtJ7U9T8PcT5iz46aYvec0x285CCBsyLoJjW3Sw&oe=6AA948CF"}, {"file_name": "3.png", "id": "1849839542992739", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823259_1849839546326072_4035769355140820369_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7Ifxuy0vlh4Q7kNvwHlEblG&_nc_oc=AdqhU7MoEYGLoeP6WHnjpTHJsLU_nOpcaB-vtD9R6blrpA6gMtGBska_FrN2ZM8HxxQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQI3qp9ckBvxdLI-xOdb-WSRJEUuOrMH0jrF0AVTGavd6A&oe=6AA9474D"}, {"file_name": "2.png", "id": "1767244957967222", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/585819904_1767244961300555_7554718931845842271_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rZTNobDnvGYQ7kNvwF9h7Wk&_nc_oc=AdpZLY5ce6BSo4Zdy_Olxx7x4w8JGWEGKBFcsYi3olJu4a7Ra20An40dm2sbvYS5vuU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLvK_lGdOs8nRh6rJYETbYrtEtKANspaGnrWmb1QVAN7g&oe=6AA9362B"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "1189718949948137", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823802_1189718953281470_378474496700656237_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gvprhaL_qvcQ7kNvwFRk_Ed&_nc_oc=Ado3qAR-fDWWbEjI6wC1Q61a1w-KS8RuLA1Uu7EIEPGQWZoprWqmtPbsSXXT3pDF7yo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKvZCqkpVtT_4_HVBs0507uOmwC_MMC7MfucfRVBGTcvQ&oe=6AA95371"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "1705557430462317", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823351_1705557437128983_2892223783731412237_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vdefvt-jC9gQ7kNvwGumu4_&_nc_oc=AdqRfep-NIBWFzQ-kuCXTc2waTQh4drJ0j3-TLNtOuPZKvMLfLCKEBP8Oa-uV1dyeVs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJKcaxrXJ4Byxpx0O9zNPPcX75xaimFCDw3rba2USkFew&oe=6AA93F05"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Feather Dodge", "keywords": ["dodge", "birds", "angry", "fly", "horizon"], "long_description": "Take Flight and Dodge the Flock in the Ultimate VR Reflex Challenge!\n\nSpread your wings and prepare for a high-speed airborne adventure in Feather Dodge! In this vibrant, fast-paced VR arcade experience, you control a swift little bird soaring through a dense, beautiful pine forest. Your mission is simple but intense: survive the incoming rush of eccentric, colorful birds flying straight your way!\n\nThe sky gets crowded quickly as a massive variety of round, stylized feathered rivals zoom past. Use your VR controllers to seamlessly weave left, right, up, and down to avoid sudden mid-air collisions. As the timer ticks up, the speed increases and the patterns become trickier, pushing your hand-eye coordination and spatial awareness to the absolute limit.\n\nHow long can you rule the forest canopy before the chaos catches up to you?\n\nKey Features:\nIntuitive VR Controls: Seamlessly guide your bird's flight path using your VR controllers for sharp, precise, and responsive dodging mechanics.\n\nFast-Paced Arcade Thrills: Experience a continuous wave of unpredictable incoming traffic that tests your reaction speed with every second.\n\nVibrant Stylized Visuals: Fly through a beautifully animated 3D forest environment filled with lush greenery, towering trees, and a colorful cast of expressive avian characters.\n\nDynamic High-Score Tracking: Watch your survival time climb in real-time, push past your limits, and try to break your personal record on every run.", "short_description": "Take flight and test your reflexes! Navigate a swift bird through a dense, endless forest, dodging incoming waves of colorful feathered rivals in this fast-paced VR arcade challenge."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://nomanawan89.wixsite.com/brokenengineers", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Broken Engineers", "support_website_url": null, "website_url"